{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Combat｜结构图\n窗口、跨帧扫掠与命中输出。[[Combat/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Combat.canvas|运行流程]]\nCombo/Boss 已接 Owned；Gate79 编译成功，7烟5 Success/2 Fail、四Case行为PASS。Legacy BP/正式资产/网络与完整Boss命中未验。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1540,
      "height": 125,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PlayerCombo / BossMelee\n原 Montage Event → Owned 窗口。\nGA 保存 Original、原 Trace、window/token。\nCombo：OpenTraceWindow / ReleaseTraceWindow。\nBoss：查询原窗，重复 Begin 保留去重。\n原回调核 Activation/来源/窗口；CleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination(Context) 释放自身原批次。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|GAS权威]] · [[BossAI/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "trace",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOMeleeTraceComponent\n`BeginTraceWindow` / `EndTraceWindow`：仅 Legacy。\n`TryOpenOwnedTraceWindow`：Socket/Radius、Expected → Out；原身份开/替换。\n`CloseOwnedTraceWindow(H)` → 只关原窗。\n`QueryOwnedTraceWindow(H)` → Active/Inactive/失败。\n`SubscribeWindowHit(H, Callback)` → 原身份回调/token。\n`UnsubscribeWindowHit(token)` → 精确退订。\n`PerformTrace` → 球扫/PhysicalMaterial。",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "mesh",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## SkeletalMesh Socket / TraceChannel\nStartSocket、EndSocket 定义判定线段；TraceRadius 与碰撞通道决定扫掠体。",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 唯一窗口机制\nuint64 WindowSerial：成功开窗递增、不复用。\nbIsTracing：活动；关窗不增 serial。\nPreviousStart/End：首帧基线。\nHitActorsThisWindow：弱引用去重。\n组件 Tick：唯一扫掠执行。\n来源/订阅随原窗清理，不建第二状态机。",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 670,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "gas",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AbilitySystem / Physics\n原身份核验 → 共享命中载荷 → GA/GE/Cue。\nCombo 依赖失败结束原动作；Boss 拒绝该 hit。\nHitResult 携请求的物理材质；Trace 不依赖 GAS。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构]] · [[Physics/结构]]",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原窗口消费与清理契约\nCombo/Boss 已消费 Owned：保存原 Activation/Trace/窗口/token；命中前核原来源和 QueryOwnedTraceWindow。消费者资源记录不是另一份活动窗口权威，Activation/结束仍归 GAS。\n原 native hit 传 OriginalWindow、Actor、HitResult；分发快照订阅并逐项核原窗/token。回调关 B 开 C 立即停 B 分发/扫掠/回写，C 自建首基线。\nGA Cleanup 匹配原 Context，先脱自身原资源，再 UnsubscribeWindowHit(原token)/CloseOwnedTraceWindow(原H)；失效不借当前来源清后继。组件生命周期/内部失败仍用私有 CloseCurrentTraceWindow，统一退订、停 Tick、清基线/去重。\nLegacy Begin/End/OnMeleeHit 保留兼容，Legacy/Owned 不接管，Owned 不复播全局事件。C++ 已接线不代表 Legacy BP/正式资产迁移或网络完成。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
